{
  "case": "create-reference-then-connect",
  "clause": "DESIGN R3.3 \u00a78.3 L651 reference creation creates DataStore + DataStoreReference; connecting it to a Task creates Association, overriding the upstream DataInputAssociation default; \u00a74.4 L408 store name",
  "derivation": "store-create (value Ledger) creates a root bpmn:DataStore named Ledger with stable-id/1(Definitions_1, store, s1) and an unnamed bpmn:DataStoreReference in Process_1 with stable-id/1(Process_1, reference, s1) whose dataStoreRef is assigned natively. The upstream connect gesture from that reference to Task_1 resolves to reference-link and appends one bpmn:Association (link recipe, direction None) to Process_1.artifacts; no DataInputAssociation or port is created on Task_1. Both reports are empty of entries (no C write, named task, standard rules off).",
